b (\zeta) = \frac {Z ^ {2} e ^ {2}}{\gamma^ {2} m _ {0} ^ {2} c ^ {2}} \langle [ B _ {X} (Z) - B _ {X \mathrm{av}} ] [ B _ {X} (Z + \zeta) - B _ {X \mathrm{av}} ] \rangle , \tag {32a}
$$ $$
