$$ Alternatively, if the power spectrum $P_{ij}(f)$ gauss $^{2}$ /cycle/sec of the field is observed, then a and b may be obtained from equation (32) and the relation $$
P _ {i j} (f) = \frac {\gamma^ {2} m _ {0} ^ {2} c ^ {2}}{Z ^ {2} e ^ {2}} \int_ {- \infty} ^ {\infty} R _ {i j} (\zeta , 0) e ^ {- 2 \pi i f \zeta / V _ {w}} \frac {d \zeta}{V _ {w}}. \tag {33}
